This package is an unofficial client of the Firebase Data Connect service (gRPC and REST). Its protocol behaviour follows the Firebase JavaScript, Android and iOS SDKs (https://github.com/firebase/firebase-js-sdk, https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk and https://github.com/firebase/firebase-ios-sdk, Apache License 2.0); the protocol buffer definitions in res/protos come from the Firebase iOS SDK. It is not a port of a Firebase SDK.

